  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening and enhancing  South African Primary  Health Care system / General Practice provision</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analysing the existing training programmes in Family Medicine, including curricula and 
assessments and identifying potential gaps in the broader training systems and structures.
Develop a roadmap with recommendations on what is advisable, feasible and 
achievable to improve them to deliver on the national government&#x2019;s strategic priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
